WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.620
move the left gripper toward the block.

2
00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:03.660
grasp the block with the left gripper.

3
00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:04.500
raise the block clear of the table.

4
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.700
present the free end of the block to the other hand.

5
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:16.560
hold the block steady and wait for the other hand to grasp it.

6
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:17.760
release the block to the other hand.

7
00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.740
withdraw the left hand from the transferred block.

8
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:56.107
keep the left arm in its current position.

